                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "deposit_action",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The laboratory apparatus <w>sediments</w> the cells from the blood sample using centrifugal force."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "A special chemical was added to <w>sediment</w> the unwanted minerals out of the solution."
